    "Indexing is excluded from phase timing, but each arm builds a fresh disposable index before measurement.",
    "Phase latency includes the complete Services::search path, not only receipt storage.",
    "Linux process write_bytes includes SQLite accounting and checkpoint writes by the whole process.",
    "The 208896-byte candidate database growth during reuse is a checkpoint of receipt pages written during create and seed; empty receipt reuse is touch-debounced.",
